text|She draws the subtle essence of touch — the capacity for contact between one form and another. Every sensation on your skin is her arrival. She is never absent from a body that breathes.|0|32.00|339.50|338.00|85.00
text|She has not been felt here yet.|0|26.00|1032.25|145.75|17.00
text|She is always here, never announced. The air on your forearm. The cloth at your collar. Contact without asking permission.|0|26.00|529.50|294.25|78.00
